    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Huh? Blaze, why are you wearing your swimsuit... and carrying some kid on your back?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I ran into this little girl on my way over here. She started hitting me for some reason."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I kicked her ass, of course, and beat down all her friends too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Gotta hand it to her, she's not bad in a fight, didn't go down easy. So I brought her along. I figured you could help me ask why she wanted to fight me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "It's Kemar. She probably just thought you looked strong. She just loves fighting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Hah. That means something, coming from you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I don't love fighting. I'm just a hands-on problem solver."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
            "focus": 2
